text:
Engineering is right that zero outages protect revenue, and Marketing is right that reach drives the funnel. However, we cannot exceed $10k. I am setting base splits to guarantee stability and baseline demand, with a reserve tied to actual paid conversions.
  Reserve: $500, released on day 30: Sales gets it on day 30 if they close at least 15 new paid AI interview accounts.
  Trade: Marketing will allocate 20% of their ad copy and creative assets directly to Sales for outbound email campaigns.
  Trade: Engineering will provide a dedicated developer to assist Sales with live custom prospect demos.
  @Marketing: Must optimize ad spend for lead quality over raw clicks to assist Sales.
  @Engineering: Must deliver zero public downtime during the launch week traffic spikes.
  @Sales: Must maximize outbound outreach to close early-adopter deals using the initial $2,000.
